al: [#D7D7AF][/dim]`bob highlights clip <URL>` turns a web article into a beautiful, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]readable, provenance-stamped PDF in the Highlights intake [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](`~/bob/xlib/blogs/` by default), which the existing `bob [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]highlights scan` turns into a `~/bob/ref/` note. The [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Cloudflare-protected OpenAI Symphony post is captured on a host [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]that can run headed Chrome (athena), and every unsupported case [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]fails loudly with a next step, never with a silently wrong PDF.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]web_url_highlights_clip.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/web_url_highlights_clip.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-35[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-35/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared target, marker, and install helpers[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]stamp-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stamp-core: factor create's target planning, collision guards, marker [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]composition, and stamp-plus-atomic-install into a shared module; add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]optional provenance marker keys; make `captured` a standard synced [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]field.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Web clip adapter capture and extraction[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]adapter-capture[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]adapter-capture: pinned uv/Playwright adapter (protocol v1) that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]launches Chrome, falls back to headed Xvfb on bot challenges, snapshots [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a stable DOM, runs vendored Defuddle in isolation, layers metadata, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]checks fidelity, sanitizes, and localizes images; placeholder renderer; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]offline self-test.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reader print template and renderer[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]reader-template[dim] · [dim][/dim]after adapter-capture[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reader-template: Bob-owned Chromium print template with bundled OFL [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fonts, masthead, Highlights-safe typography, Pillow image normalization,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]offline headless print with outline and n / N footers.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob highlights clip Rust command[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]clip-command[dim] · [dim][/dim]after stamp-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]clip-command: clap subcommand, URL validation and slug rules, source_url[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dedupe, adapter client with BOB_WEB_CLIP_ADAPTER seam, dry-run and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]success reports, doctor rows, fake-adapter CLI tests, docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Live OpenAI capture verification and docs finish[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]live-verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after reader-template, clip-command[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]live-verify: build bob, capture the OpenAI Symphony URL on athena into a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scratch vault and then the real intake queue, inspect pages and text [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]layer, prove scan writes the ref note, confirm apollo fails closed, fix [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]issues, record follow-ups.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-35","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-35.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-1545e3e4591a6c35583f6c3d4d3587c7","started_at":"2026-10-01T06:07:37.323176+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1790837723,"sha":"44bfe5898fa399eb2669b15d2525db69a0236b23","subject":"feat(highlights): add bob highlights clip subcommand"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"59b1e682b7c2114c4b18c7fdf65a48db29597d1efe1c09a2f01fea9c0ad90ac7","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-35.4/chat.md","size_bytes":3369},"commits":{"digest":"c82c0392b71f09a4c09c6ae9408a31ae73709bbcaaa686a31d21d97c0b0dfcf4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-35.4/commits.json","size_bytes":230},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-35.4/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"0ed9857ce59a9d2ec7d6c85070aa7f2677dae3e910d4f737c95db4e8aa718b58","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-35.4/meta.json","size_bytes":718},"prompt":{"digest":"054c5cf17cd41bba2a8d6f4a4013dd25e8ff031c547a6242ae9891e3fff646d2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-35.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":159},"state":{"digest":"b06288b38a26ad245fd88e4ab058bee117137be2ba38ebaf3133b0d55af2f865","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-35.4/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-35.4","local_name":"bob-cli-35.4","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-35","agent_clan_gene